<title>LEBANON: Solidere mixed ahead of GDR issue.</title>
<headline>Solidere mixed ahead of GDR issue.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Solidere shares were mixed on Tuesday as the market awaited the company's expected $125 million issue of Global Depositary Receipts.</p>
<p>Market sources have said Solidere launched an offer of 10 million GDRs on November 5 to take place on Tuesday but company officials have declined all comment.</p>
<p>Each GDR would be worth one tenth of one of Solidere's shares, the sources said.</p>
<p>A shares were slightly down on the Beirut Stock Exchange on Tuesday at $114.75 from $115 and B shares were unchanged at $117.875.</p>
<p>Turnover was 17,964 shares from Monday's 19,173 and value was $2,082,277.25 from $2,217,880.</p>
<p>-Beirut editorial (9611) 353078 645456 602057</p>
